# LexKotib backend connection (handoff §1). Two separate values:
#   VITE_API_ORIGIN   — bare origin: SignalR hub (/hubs/...) + health probes (/health/*)
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL — REST base, i.e. <origin>/api/v1
# Do NOT add the /api/v1 prefix twice — services append it themselves.
#
# Dev: the Vite server proxies /api, /hubs and /health to the origin
# (see vite.config.ts), so the backend needs no CORS. Prod: the app talks to
# these hosts directly, so the backend must allowlist the app origin (§2/§3).
#
# These are the real LexKotib production values — copy this file to .env as-is
# unless you're pointing at a different backend (staging, local, etc.).
VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://api.beezy.uz
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.beezy.uz/api/v1
